      "desc": "Use this Blueprint at the Smart Workshop to unlock the recipe for this item. Obtained through investigations.\n\nItem Effect: Use this item to transform into a phantom of the <color=#FFAF2C>Scorched Horizon</color>, dealing DMG equal to <color=#2BAD00>100%</color>/<color=#2BAD00>50%</color>/<color=#2BAD00>20%</color> of Max HP to normal/elite/boss enemies, respectively. It also rapidly accumulates <color=#2BAD00>100%</color> Daze and extends the enemy's Dazed state by <color=#2BAD00>3</color>s.",
